<title>USA: Federal Reserve business loans up in Jan 22 week.</title>
<headline>Federal Reserve business loans up in Jan 22 week.</headline>
<text>
<p>ONE WEEK ENDED JANUARY 22</p>
<p>(Seasonally adjusted, millions of dollars)</p>
<p> Business loans............792,500 up.....2,100</p>
<p> U.S. Govt securities......702,100 up.....5,700</p>
<p> Large time deposits.......514,600 down...3,100</p>
<p> U.S. commercial paper.....806,329 up.....3,873</p>
<p> Financial companies.......618,488 up.....5,752</p>
<p> New York business loans....43,546 up.......244</p>
<p> Excluding acceptances......43,319 up.......252</p>
</text>
